{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Swing like a real spider</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the abandoned wetlands, you use spider silk to nimbly swing and suspend yourself, navigating through the dilapidated surroundings. Facing various hostile insects lurking in the microscopic ecosystem, you need precise shooting and agile reflexes to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, fight, swing\u2014this is a survival and adventure story about insects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Game feature</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Jump, grapple, swing, glide... Your movement is full of possibilities. Attack your enemies in unexpected ways. But don't fall into the water \u2013 there might be other dangers lurking...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/19b09d32d35c06acb653c3ab07127ca6.poster.avif?t=1758098411\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/19b09d32d35c06acb653c3ab07127ca6.webm?t=1758098411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/19b09d32d35c06acb653c3ab07127ca6.mp4?t=1758098411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your arsenal to combat escalating threats! Keep an eye out for those aspergillus flavus \u2013 destroying them will charge your weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/1356ca569ca73b0214325a71fc94bf03.poster.avif?t=1758098411\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/1356ca569ca73b0214325a71fc94bf03.webm?t=1758098411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/1356ca569ca73b0214325a71fc94bf03.mp4?t=1758098411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to this overlooked wetland, where peculiar ecosystems and unique landscapes thrive. But beware \u2013 this realm has its own rules!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/5b6c694ca044edd857b2e74731e865cc.poster.avif?t=1758098411\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/5b6c694ca044edd857b2e74731e865cc.webm?t=1758098411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/5b6c694ca044edd857b2e74731e865cc.mp4?t=1758098411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3361000?t=1758098411","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/760fd9478d073e80b607e3514bf195752cbb090b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758098411","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/650e70b1ba9c9abc1d8fb1ad3dcdf2bbee88fec2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758098411","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/650e70b1ba9c9abc1d8fb1ad3dcdf2bbee88fec2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758098411","categ